# SMT_PKG_PATH
#   Points to the local checkout of the proprietary SMT package that provides
#   scan_smts_historical(). This variable is optional — it is only required for
#   the smt_cisd analysis and any prepare_pair(with_swing_smt=True) call.
#   When absent or pointing to a non-existent path, both cisd_analysis.py and
#   build_forward_returns.py degrade gracefully: smt_cisd is skipped with a
#   [warn] line and all other analyses complete normally.
#
#   Default (WSL dev machine):
SMT_PKG_PATH=/mnt/e/backup/code/Finance/Misc/SMT
